<title>PORTUGAL: MOTOR RACING-FRENTZEN TOPS TESTING TIMES.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-FRENTZEN TOPS TESTING TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>ESTORIL, Portugal 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>German Heinz-Harald Frentzen showed on Wednesday he will be a real challenger for this year's Formula One world championship when he was fastest during testing.</p>
<p>The Williams driver, who has so far been generally out-paced by team mate Canadian Jacques Villeneuve in the pre-season build up, set a best lap of one minute 18.68 seconds around this Portuguese track.</p>
<p>Frenchman Jean Alesi was second fastest in 1:19.09  with Villeneuve third quickest with 1:19.48.</p>
</text>
